id:                     E3368
title: 模块可加载与静态版本可解析分别验证
trigger_tool: perl|make
phase: configuration|testing
error_signature: Argument undef is not numeric in numeric ge; parse_version returns undef for inline package and VERSION
severity:               2
category: perl, testing, metadata
match_keywords: parse_version, get_version, inline package declaration, VERSION assignment, static module metadata, real generated bundle
root_cause: ExtUtils::MM_Unix逐行提取VERSION赋值并在专用包内eval；若同一行先出现package声明，赋值转入该包，解析器读取自身局部化VERSION时得到undef。模块可以正常require并不代表其静态版本可被构建工具正确解析，进而会使真实版本选择走错分支。
affected_scope: 使用逐行VERSION扫描与eval的模块选择工具及其自有测试夹具
verification_cmd: actual target make test plus installed packlist and generated-stub consumers
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: verify-static-metadata-before-runtime-selection
rec_description: 读取目标实际版本解析实现和真实错误；将自有测试夹具package声明、VERSION赋值分别放在独立行，先通过真实parse_version断言所需版本，再在独立进程中调用生成的加载stub，核对bundled/installed来源、版本选择和import调用者/参数。实际安装packlist打包另验且逐文件与原模块比较；不修改上游实现，不伪造解析结果、不改变比较逻辑。
rec_command: ExtUtils::MM->parse_version(actual fixture path) must equal intended version before generated loader is exercised
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: Keep official module bytes; separate package and VERSION source lines in owned fixtures; compare both static metadata and real fresh-process chosen source, caller and import arguments.
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/E2026101615364-draft-A139.md
last_updated: 2026-10-16
source_event: perl-inc-latest-0.500-official-20261016-r698; actual r693 undef failure retained; r698 two native creates registered1/1 C3H1; W3log 65d6ca63b59454c5af957dd608dbc4e58d56a6dfbf0a86db737e83d553e8da8b
